      {
        "id": 194321,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-11T20:54:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"waedens\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> waedens:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I gave Crista a fish.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is amazing, and I can't explain why.</p>\n<p>It's good to know they live in a tower! All heroes should be headquartered in one. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
