        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-12T13:37:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I will post a picture of Handelabra Tower when I get back and can edit down the file size.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately no wise cracking in the background for me. I wanted to be respectful of their time. Besides Jeremy and John were funny enough last night. I particularly like the sign-off when you can still hear Jeremy saying “were off right? They can’t still hear us” for some reason that really cracked me up.</p>\n<p>Hopefully we can do a more organized get together in the future.</p>",
